be able to meet

00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:00.280
those demands with flexible
and scalable technology.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:03.610
Apigee applies security and
traffic management policies

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:05.980
and routes requests
to microservices

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:09.220
while orchestrating your legacy
services and monolith apps.

