00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.600
Common technology stacks not
disparate technology stacks.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.530
Well-documented and
discoverable services available

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:01.780
in a self-service model,
rapid onboarding of customers

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.250
and consumers--

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.120
weeks, minutes, hours, not
days, months, and years.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:10.370
Highly agile,
adaptable work streams,

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:13.030
and a constantly
evolving capability that

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:16.440
doesn't necessarily require
