00:23:10.440 --> 00:23:14.292
We're going API to API,
which drastically changes

00:23:14.292 --> 00:23:15.750
the performance
and the interaction

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:19.690
that we have with them and,
ultimately, the satisfaction,

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:21.470
which is fantastic.

00:23:21.470 --> 00:23:23.940
And then we're getting
a lot more visibility.

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:27.270
We're already start to see
and learn and discover things

00:23:27.270 --> 00:23:29.670
about how we were doing those.

00:23:29.670 --> 00:23:33.960
Looking forward,
we're releasing a lot

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:36.420
