product suites,

00:23:36.420 --> 00:23:39.840
talent verification services
for human resources,

00:23:39.840 --> 00:23:42.630
our government services
that are coming through,

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:48.510
our largest division, USIS,
opened up the data hub concept,

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:51.750
which is being able
to open up data

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:53.670
sources in a very
protected and regulated

00:23:53.670 --> 00:23:57.990
manner to the outside world.

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:01.380
That, of course, you can imagine
has a lot of things around it.

00:24:01.380 --> 00:24:02.130
But you know what?

00:24:02.130 --> 00:24:04.200
Data exchange is what
the world's about.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:09.210
So we are one of the
largest keepers of data.

00:24:09.210 --> 00:24:13.770
We want to enable
the market to be

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:17.910
able to use that to
improve consumer life,

00:24:17.910 --> 00:24:23.640
improve customer life, improve
business, improve whatever

00:24:23.640 --> 00:24:24.970
your use case might be.

00:24:24.970 --> 00:24:34.246
So I think with that, we'll
