00:33:34.930 --> 00:33:36.100
that we have here.

00:33:36.100 --> 00:33:39.070
So to get a token, you need
to subscribe to the product

00:33:39.070 --> 00:33:40.850
and then generate a token.

00:33:40.850 --> 00:33:45.640
So I'm going to go ahead
and click on the Subscribe,

