that subscription here.

00:34:19.409 --> 00:34:21.780
This is the one that
just got created,

00:34:21.780 --> 00:34:26.429
and it will actually show
them all the credentials that

00:34:26.429 --> 00:34:30.790
are created for them to generate
a OAuth2 authorization token.

00:34:30.790 --> 00:34:36.340
So now I go back, and I
want to go ahead and create

00:34:36.340 --> 00:34:39.920
a token, OAuth token, that
I need for the API calls.

00:34:39.920 --> 00:34:44.620
So I just click on
the token API call.

00:34:44.620 --> 00:34:47.750
I want to just take
